# STAGE A e17c72c (2026-10-16): verdict 1 on the regenerated angled clusters (clusters_ang_e17/,
# also on EOS response_sim/clusters/*_e17_t0.root). Same recipe as Aug 9 (4 GeV mu-, ArIso, 3000 ev,
# 31.2 mm spread, src 100 mm), new seeds, built at e17c72c+ (PAI in the gas, ideal-gas density,
# proper mass fractions). nPrimDrift medians 0.898-0.915 of the old files (all 5 angles).
# bG 0.45 is the clean A/B against verdict 1; 0.50 / 0.55 refit the feedback for the lower
# primary count. s 1.75, tp 166, noise _cmq, rho2M as verdict 1.
#
# PRE-REGISTERED (2026-10-16, before submission), ledger_m3 p50 data/sim vs verdict 1
# (X 0.93/0.89/0.95, Y 1.04/1.06/1.07):
#   * bG 0.45: every p50 data/sim up by 7-12 % (primaries -9 %; the avalanche and shaper are
#     linear below the rail, saturation pulls the vertical X point to the low end). X sat fraction
#     falls by 0.03-0.08. Inclined rise / FWHM within +-4 ns of verdict 1 (shape does not see gain).
#   * bG 0.50 / 0.55: p50 data/sim falls back by 6-9 % / 13-18 % relative to bG 0.45; the joint
#     X+Y p50 optimum moves to bG 0.49-0.53.
# FALSIFIER: bG 0.45 p50 data/sim moves < 4 % or > 15 % anywhere -> the primaries do not feed the
#   amplitude linearly (check Stage B's nPrimary handling), or the new seeds matter more than the fix.
universe                = vanilla
executable              = /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/run_stageBC_w2.sh
log                     = /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/logs/w2.log
request_cpus            = 4
request_memory          = 16000
request_disk            = 12000000
+JobFlavour             = "workday"
MY.SendCredential       = true
environment             = "OMP_NUM_THREADS=4"
arguments               = "rho2M e17b$(bgt)_$(ang) /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/calib/noise_det3_satscan_feu07_cmq.json /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/clusters_ang_e17/mx17_muons_3k_ang_$(ang)_e17_t0.root '--ion-speed-scale 1.75 --feedback-bg $(bg) --shaper-tp-ns 166'"
output                  = /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/logs/stageBC_e17b$(bgt)_$(ang).out
error                   = /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/logs/stageBC_e17b$(bgt)_$(ang).err
queue bgt, bg, ang from (
45, 0.45, th00
45, 0.45, thx10
45, 0.45, thx20
45, 0.45, thy10
45, 0.45, thy20
50, 0.50, th00
50, 0.50, thx10
50, 0.50, thx20
50, 0.50, thy10
50, 0.50, thy20
55, 0.55, th00
55, 0.55, thx10
55, 0.55, thx20
55, 0.55, thy10
55, 0.55, thy20
)
